<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Opinion alignment before (<math id="A1.T7.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math>) and after (<math id="A1.T7.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V_{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{C}</annotation></semantics></math>) calibration for OQA demographics using base-prompted, verbalized elicitation. Each pair of columns compares the base-generated distributions to the calibrated distributions (C), with significant differences between the two bolded. The two “Average” columns on the right are averages across models.</figcaption>
</figure>
