<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Sociodemographic prompts</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Sociodemographic prompts are shown in Table <a href="#A2.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ B.3 Sociodemographic prompts ‣ Appendix B Prompts (Reproducibility) ‣ Beyond Sociodemographic Prompting: Using Supervision to Align LLMs with Human Response Distributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T13" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T13.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
