<span id="A2.T13.p1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">What percentage of people whose {att} is {c} would respond with {answer choices} to</span></span>
<span id="A2.T13.p1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
